<title>POLAND: WBK JULY NET RISES TO PLN 17.0 MLN.</title>
<headline>WBK JULY NET RISES TO PLN 17.0 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    17.04 vs  12.34</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	26.76 vs  20.52</p>
<p> Operating profit    48.46 vs  36.50</p>
<p> Sales		   84.16 vs  68.51</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    94.92 vs  93.44</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit     147.36 vs 139.82</p>
<p> Operating profit   292.43 vs 253.99</p>
<p> Sales		  547.85 vs 462.80</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Wielkopolski Bank</p>
<p>Kredytowy SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
